WEBVTT

download
00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:12.599
Start from the release download: the
tarball, its checksums and the installer.

checksum
00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:16.404
Check that the download is
exactly what was published.

install
00:00:16.484 --> 00:00:20.919
The installer unpacks one
self-contained tree and links plaintake.

version
00:00:21.819 --> 00:00:26.212
Put it on your PATH,
and plaintake is ready.

validate
00:00:27.909 --> 00:00:33.715
A demo is one TypeScript file. validate
checks it before any browser starts.

run-command
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:40.304
One command films it in Chromium
and renders it with FFmpeg.

scenario-file
00:00:41.648 --> 00:00:46.802
While it records — this is the file
it follows, defineDemo and all.

step-anatomy
00:00:46.882 --> 00:00:51.487
A step names its target, its action
and the caption you are reading.

assert-outcome
00:00:51.567 --> 00:00:55.917
An assert fails the run if the
app ends up in the wrong state.

rendered
00:00:57.247 --> 00:01:01.348
Done: one MP4, captions burned in.

bundle-tree
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:05.153
Captions, a manifest and
a trace ship beside it.

watch-output
00:01:05.182 --> 00:01:08.533
And this is the exact
file that run just wrote.

verify
00:01:19.477 --> 00:01:23.558
verify re-checks every
artifact against the manifest.

whole-loop
00:01:23.638 --> 00:01:27.363
Write, validate, run, verify
— then ship the video.
